## Modular Architecture (Jan 2026)

**See**: `flowstral-desktop/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` for full details.

### Shared Modules
```
lib/
├── action-handlers.js     # UNIFIED execution - ALL playback goes here
├── salesforce-handlers.js # SF-specific actions (connect, query, etc.)
├── smart-finder.js        # 10-phase element finding
├── ai-fallback.js         # AI vision fallback (shared)
├── recording-utils.js     # Text normalization (shared)
├── element-recipe.js      # Recipe model
└── mobile-config.js       # Mobile emulation config

ipc/
├── index.js               # IPC handler registration
├── recorder-handlers.js   # Playwright recorder IPC
└── mobile-handlers.js     # Mobile testing IPC
```

### Import Pattern
```javascript
// Both executors use:
const ActionHandlers = require('./lib/action-handlers');
const result = await ActionHandlers.executeAction(ctx, action, { timeout });

// Salesforce actions:
const SalesforceHandlers = require('./lib/salesforce-handlers');
const sfResult = await SalesforceHandlers.handleSalesforceAction(ctx, action, options);
```

## Playback Fallback Order

1. **SmartFinder** (10-phase, with retry) → 95% success
2. **Legacy _findElement** (50+ strategies) → 4% additional
3. **iFrame Search** (search inside iframes)
4. **AI Vision Fallback** (GPT-4o screenshot) → 1% additional
5. **Report failure** with details

## CRITICAL: Text Normalization

**ALWAYS normalize text for matching:**
```javascript
const normalizeTextForMatching = (text) => {
  if (!text || typeof text !== 'string') return '';
  return text
    .replace(/[\u2018\u2019\u201B\u2032\u0060\u00B4\u02BC]/g, "'") // Apostrophes
    .replace(/[\u201C\u201D\u201E\u201F\u2033]/g, '"')              // Quotes
    .replace(/\s+/g, ' ')                                          // Whitespace
    .trim();
};
```

## CRITICAL: New Tab Handling

**Recording**: Must call `_setupConsoleListenerForPage(newPage, pageIndex)` for EACH new tab
**Playback**: Must detect new tabs after clicks and switch `this.page`

## Key Patterns

### Element Finding with Retry
```javascript
await this.retryWithBackoff(async () => {
  // Try SmartFinder, then legacy
}, { maxRetries: 3, baseDelay: 500 });
```

### Recipe Format
```javascript
{
  what: { role: 'button', text: 'Submit' },
  where: { landmark: 'main' },
  which: { position: 2, testId: 'submit-btn', ariaLabel: '...' }
}
```

### AI Fallback
```javascript
const coords = await this.findElementWithAI(description, 'click');
await this.page.mouse.click(coords.x, coords.y);
```

### Console-Based Action Capture
```javascript
// Recording scripts emit:
console.log('__FLOWSTRAL_CLICK__:' + JSON.stringify(clickData));

// Captured by:
page.on('console', (msg) => {
  if (msg.text().startsWith('__FLOWSTRAL_CLICK__:')) {
    // Parse and store
  }
});
```

## Configuration Flags

```javascript
// In PlaywrightRecorder:
useRecipeRecorder: true          // Recipe-based recording
useSmartFinderForPlayback: true  // SmartFinder for playback
enableAIFallback: true           // AI vision as last resort
maxAICallsPerRun: 5              // Budget per test
```

## Common Issues & Solutions

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Wrong element clicked | Check elementIndex/position |
| Element not found | Check SmartFinder logs, verify text normalization |
| Apostrophe mismatch | Ensure normalizeTextForMatching is applied |
| Double space in text | normalizeText collapses with `.replace(/\s+/g, ' ')` |
| Actions not recorded in new tab | Verify _setupConsoleListenerForPage called |
| AI not working | Check OPENAI_API_KEY env var or backend running |
| text.replace error | Check `typeof text === 'string'` before .replace() |
| Duplicate steps recorded | Check 50ms timestamp window deduplication |
| Duplicate switchTab actions | Ensure polling loop updates `_lastDetectedFocusTab` |
| Tab switching confusing | Check `a.qword === 'SwitchTab'` not `a.type` |

## CRITICAL: Deduplication

**Click deduplication uses 50ms time windows:**
```javascript
const roundedTimestamp = Math.floor(click.timestamp / 50) * 50;
const clickId = `cdp_${roundedTimestamp}_${click.description}`;
```

**SwitchTab deduplication checks both qword and type:**
```javascript
const alreadyHasActionFromTab = recentActions.some(a => 
  (a.qword === 'SwitchTab' && a.tabIndex === i) ||
  (a.type === 'switchTab' && a.tabIndex === i) ||
  (a.tabIndex === i)
);
```

## Debug Logging

When troubleshooting, look for these logs:
```
[PlaywrightRecorder] ========== ELEMENT FINDING DEBUG ==========
[PlaywrightRecorder] Action data: { type, text, label, ... }
[PlaywrightRecorder] Recipe for SmartFinder: { what, where, which }
[SmartFinder] Trying strategy: role+text
[PlaywrightRecorder] ========== AI FALLBACK CHECK ==========
```

